{"id":"wb-5-366","name":"岳阳文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"岳阳文庙","text":"岳阳文庙，又名岳州文庙、岳州学宫，位于湖南省岳阳市翰林街（又称郭亮街）学道岭岳阳市第二中学内部。文庙于北宋年间修建，民国初期开始举办新学堂，1983年被列为湖南省重点文物保护单位。2001年6月，被国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B2%B3%E9%98%B3%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86783157,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783157","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/da58542dbe2c88cd52260b67.jpg","title":"20240720-岳阳文庙-大成殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240720-%E5%B2%B3%E9%98%B3%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99-%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/20240720-%E5%B2%B3%E9%98%B3%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99-%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Saigyouji-Noriko","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​岳阳文庙-大成殿","width":320,"height":213}}